    <td style="border-bottom: Black 4pt double; font-weight: bold; text-align: left">&#160;</td><td style="border-bottom: Black 4pt double; font-weight: bold; text-align: right"><ix:nonFraction contextRef="c2" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:TaxesPayableCurrent" scale="0" unitRef="usd" id="ixv-13163">1,607,418</ix:nonFraction></td><td style="padding-bottom: 4pt; font-weight: bold; text-align: left">&#160;</td></tr>
  </table></ix:nonNumeric>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><b>&#160;</b></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: left; text-indent: 0.25in">Due to the invalidation of
invoices from a supplier of JYD SM by the tax authorities, the Group accrued RMB <ix:nonFraction contextRef="c1" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:TaxesPayableCurrentAndNoncurrent" scale="6" unitRef="cny" id="ixv-13164">10.8</ix:nonFraction> million (approximately US$<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c1" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:TaxesPayableCurrentAndNoncurrent" scale="6" unitRef="usd" id="ixv-13165">1.5</ix:nonFraction> million) VAT tax payable
as of Dec 31, 2024. As of the date that the Interim Condensed Consolidated Financial Statements were available to be issued, JYD SM is
coordinating with the tax authorities to properly resolve this matter.</p></ix:nonNumeric><div>

</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: center">&#160;</p><div>


</div><!-- Field: Page; Sequence: 31; Value: 1 --><div>
