<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.25in">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-indent: 0.25in">As of December 31, 2024, prepaid expenses to Winpass
and Cargo Link represent the prepayments for chartered airline freight services to enhance the Group&#8217;s service to USA and South
Asia market. The prepayments to Winpass were fully refunded during the six months ended June 30, 2025 due to the change of market for
chartered airline services. The prepayments to Cargo link were fully applied against the service charges incurred during the six month
ended June 30, 2025.</p></ix:nonNumeric><div>

</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-indent: 0.25in">&#160;</p><div>

