<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.25in">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-indent: 0.25in">In January 2025, in order to fulfill the operating
needs of No. 3 LLC&#160;and No. 10 LLC, the shareholders of No. 3 LLC&#160;and No. 10 LLC agreed to make loans to each company based on
their share of interests. As a result, the Group signed a one-year loan agreement with No. 3 LLC&#160;and No. 10 LLC, respectively, with
a total amount of RMB<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c384" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ShortTermBorrowings" scale="0" unitRef="cny" id="ixv-13524">1,004,841</ix:nonFraction> (US$ <ix:nonFraction contextRef="c384" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ShortTermBorrowings" scale="0" unitRef="usd" id="ixv-13525">140,368</ix:nonFraction>). The loans bear no interest, and due in January 2026. During the six months ended June 30,
2025, RMB <ix:nonFraction contextRef="c0" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:RepaymentsOfRelatedPartyDebt" scale="0" unitRef="cny" id="ixv-13526">68,935</ix:nonFraction> (US$ <ix:nonFraction contextRef="c0" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:RepaymentsOfRelatedPartyDebt" scale="0" unitRef="usd" id="ixv-13527">9,630</ix:nonFraction>) was repaid to the Group, and RMB <ix:nonFraction contextRef="c0" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="jyd:RelatedPartyTransactionOutstandingBalance" scale="0" unitRef="cny" id="ixv-13528">935,906</ix:nonFraction> (US$ <ix:nonFraction contextRef="c0" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="jyd:RelatedPartyTransactionOutstandingBalance" scale="0" unitRef="usd" id="ixv-13529">130,739</ix:nonFraction>) was outstanding as of June 30, 2025.</p></ix:continuation><div>

</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-indent: 0.25in">&#160;</p><div>


